Provenance of the plugin
------------------------
plugin/index.ts was written for this project from an analysis of Discord's
web client code. It disables the feature gate that switches the profile badge
list to its collapsed "+n" layout.

An earlier plugin with the same purpose and name exists:
https://github.com/ItzMeShadow999/showAllBadges (GPL-3.0-or-later). It was
known to the author and takes a different approach (it rewrites the derived
flag that follows the gate). None of its code is included here.

